{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program' data-target='computer\/program' data-title='Program'>\r\n\t\t\tProgram\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on MySQL: Authentication, Commands, Export output to file, Function, Import, and Insert, and related topics.","label":"MySQL","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/microsoft_word","label":"Microsoft Word","url":"\/computer\/program\/microsoft_word"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/netbeans","label":"Netbeans","url":"\/computer\/program\/netbeans"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t\t<div class='content-image-container'>\r\n\t<div class='cover-image cover-image-tile'>\r\n\t\t<img src='\/computer\/program\/mysql.svg' alt='Working notes on MySQL: Authentication, Commands, Export output to file, Function, Import, and Insert, and related topics.' style='object-fit: contain; object-position: center'>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<p class='cover-credit'>\n\t<span class='cover-credit-anchor'>\n\t\t<button type='button' class='cover-credit-toggle' aria-expanded='false' aria-label='Image credit'>\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns='http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg' viewBox='0 0 16 16' width='14' height='14' aria-hidden='true' focusable='false'>\n\t\t\t\t<circle cx='8' cy='8' r='6.25' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.2'\/>\n\t\t\t\t<circle cx='8' cy='5.2' r='0.85' fill='currentColor'\/>\n\t\t\t\t<path fill='currentColor' d='M7.28 7.15h1.44v4.55H7.28z'\/>\n\t\t\t<\/svg>\n\t\t<\/button>\n\t\t<span class='cover-credit-popup'><a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/simple-icons\/simple-icons\/blob\/15.0.0\/icons\/mysql.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Simple Icons contributors<\/a> \/ <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/simple-icons\/simple-icons\/blob\/15.0.0\/icons\/mysql.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Simple Icons<\/a> \u2014 <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/creativecommons.org\/publicdomain\/zero\/1.0\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC0 1.0<\/a><\/span>\n\t<\/span>\n<\/p>\n\n\t<h2 class='center'>Working notes on MySQL: Authentication, Commands, Export output to file, Function, Import, and Insert, and related topics.<\/h2>\n\t\t<p>\n\t\tWorking notes on MySQL: Authentication, Commands, Export output to file, Function, Import, and Insert, and related topics.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Topics<\/h2>\n\t<h4>Authentication<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSetting the \u201cauthentication plugin\u201d to the older one at the user level is not sufficient if the \u201cdefault authentication plugin\u201d for the server is set to the newer plugin.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Commands<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tShows databases;.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Export output to file<\/h4>\n\t<ol class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>SELECT order_id,product_name,qty.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<h4>Function<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEscape.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Import<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tImport: -u username -p -h 202.54.1.10 &lt;, and --max_allowed_packet=100M.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Insert<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tInsert: insert into &lt;table&gt; values (\u2018&lt;value&gt;\u2019|NULL...).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Mac<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tExports PATH=$PATH:\/usr\/local\/mysql\/bin.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Manage<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tMySQL status.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Password<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tUPDATE mysql.user SET Password=PASSWORD('MyNewPass') WHERE User='root';.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Remote access<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttp:\/\/www.cyberciti.biz\/faq\/unix-linux-mysqld-server-bind-to-more-than-one-ip-address.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Replace<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tReplace: UPDATE &lt;table&gt;, and UPDATE SET &lt;column&gt; = REPLACE(&lt;column&gt;, '&lt;existing.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Security<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttps:\/\/docs.oracle.com\/cd\/E17952_01\/refman-5.5-en\/security-against-attack.html.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Status<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tStatus: # mysqladmin -u root -p status.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Table Information<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSelect * from information_schema.tables.\n\t<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/mysql\/authentication' data-target='computer\/program\/mysql\/authentication' data-title='Authentication'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/program\/mysql\/authentication\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Authentication<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/mysql\/commands' data-target='computer\/program\/mysql\/commands' data-title='Commands'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/program\/mysql\/commands\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Commands<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/mysql\/export_output_to_file' data-target='computer\/program\/mysql\/export_output_to_file' data-title='Export output to file'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/program\/mysql\/export_output_to_file\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Export output to file<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\